{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a free demo version of our upcoming co-op survival horror game.</i><br>In this limited version, you and up to 3 friends can explore the cursed castle and get a taste of the gameplay, atmosphere, and terror that awaits in the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870400/extras/6389e6848e607c247efbb202e903809a.poster.avif?t=1758530558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870400/extras/6389e6848e607c247efbb202e903809a.webm?t=1758530558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870400/extras/6389e6848e607c247efbb202e903809a.mp4?t=1758530558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's included in the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 playable separate area</strong> of the cursed castle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic version</strong> of the Jester  with limited AI behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 4-player online co-op</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity voice chat support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound detection from the Jester</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selection of <strong>items and mechanics</strong> from the full game (basic rune collection and ritual preparation)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is designed to give you a short but intense preview of the core gameplay loop. Some features and content are not yet included and will be available in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870400/extras/f279be6583069eb83d827efc90e85aed.poster.avif?t=1758530558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870400/extras/f279be6583069eb83d827efc90e85aed.webm?t=1758530558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870400/extras/f279be6583069eb83d827efc90e85aed.mp4?t=1758530558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOT included in the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full castle map and all areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced AI behavior and full Jester mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full variety of items and environmental hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exorcising final ritual</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Full Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the complete game, you will explore a vast, cursed castle, uncover ancient runes, and perform rituals to lift the Jester\u2019s evil curse. Each run offers unique challenges, increased replayability, and more dangerous threats as the AI adapts to your progress.<br><br><strong>Note:</strong> This demo is a work in progress and does not represent the final quality of the game. Feedback is welcome!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870400?t=1758530558","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870400?t=1758530558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870400/0820997d766cedbf7e87795f4bd02fad52bad09e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758530558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870400/0820997d766cedbf7e87795f4bd02fad52bad09e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758530558","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game pictures a Jester which can be scary for young audiences. "},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a free demo version of our upcoming co-op survival horror game.</i><br>In this limited version, you and up to 3 friends can explore the cursed castle and get a taste of the gameplay, atmosphere, and terror that awaits in the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870400/extras/6389e6848e607c247efbb202e903809a.poster.avif?t=1758530558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870400/extras/6389e6848e607c247efbb202e903809a.webm?t=1758530558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870400/extras/6389e6848e607c247efbb202e903809a.mp4?t=1758530558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's included in the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 playable separate area</strong> of the cursed castle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic version</strong> of the Jester  with limited AI behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 4-player online co-op</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity voice chat support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound detection from the Jester</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selection of <strong>items and mechanics</strong> from the full game (basic rune collection and ritual preparation)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is designed to give you a short but intense preview of the core gameplay loop. Some features and content are not yet included and will be available in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870400/extras/f279be6583069eb83d827efc90e85aed.poster.avif?t=1758530558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870400/extras/f279be6583069eb83d827efc90e85aed.webm?t=1758530558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870400/extras/f279be6583069eb83d827efc90e85aed.mp4?t=1758530558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOT included in the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full castle map and all areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced AI behavior and full Jester mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full variety of items and environmental hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exorcising final ritual</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Full Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the complete game, you will explore a vast, cursed castle, uncover ancient runes, and perform rituals to lift the Jester\u2019s evil curse. Each run offers unique challenges, increased replayability, and more dangerous threats as the AI adapts to your progress.<br><br><strong>Note:</strong> This demo is a work in progress and does not represent the final quality of the game. Feedback is welcome!</p>","developers":["Fire Foot Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3607770","name":"Jester: A Foolish Ritual"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870400/3eb0c54621af407ff257792e980ef7ceefdb72a9/header.jpg?t=1758530558","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3870400/727923779/5739f63e70b6517e920a80c009fdd0ba189a525c/1758485372/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758529352","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3870400/727923779/5739f63e70b6517e920a80c009fdd0ba189a525c/1758485372/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758529352","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3870400/727923779/5739f63e70b6517e920a80c009fdd0ba189a525c/1758485372/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758529352","id":257203492,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203492/movie480.mp4?t=1758529352","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203492/movie_max.mp4?t=1758529352"},"name":"Jester: A Foolish Ritual Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets